Cell["\<\
In the above example,  the order of consecutive inputs is not preserved in \
the output. Inserting a permutation encodes the order:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d93c0bbe-a6a3-4249-87d3-f8c106d25c8b"],

